[{"client_msg_id":"84e4fb69-8344-4162-9328-05ccb7ed8d45","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"親指シフトも中指シフトも日本語入力でタイプ数増やしたくないから導入したし・・・","ts":"1628515173.322500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fa3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ec777b2e-89e4-4d61-b711-c655e111a141","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"左右分離型キーボードはいいぞ","ts":"1628515055.321600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"t8m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8b4d18e4-7897-407d-91bc-c312427330d1","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"アームレスト効果あるんですかねぇ…。","ts":"1628513635.321200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P9oWp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9a1e7ba8-fdb3-4889-a7a9-51a39c0c8827","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"椅子側にアームレストあるとだいぶ違うかもなあという感じはしてる\n今ないんですよね……","ts":"1628513533.320500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zQR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"98f6baaf-99ed-42e0-8a17-c7bd4d4b1f75","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"自分は結構無意識にやってしまうのですが、肘を少し伸ばして手首をプラプラさせる動作が腱鞘炎予防にいいとか何とか。","ts":"1628513464.319600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dvc+t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cf3bc22c-aa53-4422-897d-bea98ce3495f","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"大玉（人差し指や中指などで操作するタイプ）はどうも慣れなくて封印してしまった…。","ts":"1628512843.317300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Whpjw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"20b21a3d-b862-49b6-a577-1762a6ddb0d3","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"おそらくソフトドームを使っていましたね","ts":"1628512742.316500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pxROM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"46ac250a-d2d1-40c2-ab84-08c062726339","type":"message","user":"U76V658V6","text":"トラックポイントのキャップをクラシックドームやソフトドームにしていると、どうしてもキャップに力を加えて押すことになるので、たしかにこの２種類のキャップだと腱鞘炎になりそうですね。","ts":"1628511703.316100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8EWo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6deb34b9-08f5-4d59-95df-69c8516d82e8","type":"message","user":"U76V658V6","text":"今、ちょっと試してみたのですがいい感じですね。しばらくこの設定で行こうかと思います。","ts":"1628511592.314700","thread_ts":"1628507949.307800","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"weltu"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"ae4c0a6c-a97b-4051-91c8-40df9d613440","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"ELECOM HUGEのFn3を押しながらボール転がすとスクロールするようにしてるんですけど、これLinuxのEasyStrokeじゃないと使えないのでちょっと辛い\nWindowsで使う時はしょうがないのでFn3をホイールクリックにしてる","ts":"1628507949.307800","thread_ts":"1628507949.307800","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DoGes"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"eb7dcc22-3381-4950-bcac-9025981eaebf","type":"message","user":"U76V658V6","text":"トラックポイントのキャップをソフトリムにすると、キャップのエッジに軽く指の重さをかけると力をほとんど入れなくてもアローポインタがススっと動くのです。アローポインタを大きく動かしたいときはキャップのエッジに乗せる指に少しだけ力を加えると、フニョっとアローポインタが大きく動くのです。","ts":"1628511501.314600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1Z9xC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b705526d-7df2-458b-908b-3b85e0fea38a","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"私が腱鞘炎で病院行った時は、肩凝りが原因だって言われました。だから、消炎剤とか使ったところで根本直さないと繰り返すよと。ピップエレキバン+スタンディングデスクを使ってからは肩凝りマシになって腱鞘炎も減りました。ケースバイケースだと思うので参考までに。","ts":"1628508467.311000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IDPA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ae4c0a6c-a97b-4051-91c8-40df9d613440","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"ELECOM HUGEのFn3を押しながらボール転がすとスクロールするようにしてるんですけど、これLinuxのEasyStrokeじゃないと使えないのでちょっと辛い\nWindowsで使う時はしょうがないのでFn3をホイールクリックにしてる","ts":"1628507949.307800","thread_ts":"1628507949.307800","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U76V658V6"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DoGes"}]},{"client_msg_id":"55a04e32-6f2a-41bf-ade1-c48ae00f68f0","type":"message","user":"U76V658V6","text":"ブラウザにも Vim 系のアドオンを入れてます。","ts":"1628507753.305600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]},{"name":"benri","count":1,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ"]},{"name":"hai-small","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dEFW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9d9bde5d-0155-47b7-a014-48c3181d0ea0","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"キーボード操作でなおかつ特殊キーを比較的使わない Vim は腱鞘炎対策に良い…？","ts":"1628507075.305000","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1628507085.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BLa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f1489d8d-db61-43d5-a588-faf377e592d2","type":"message","user":"U76V658V6","text":"トラックポイントにするとポインティングデバイスを無意識になるべく使わないようにしているのかもしれません。","ts":"1628506857.304400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i0iE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6d640075-a76a-425a-9441-cb4ace325648","type":"message","user":"U76V658V6","text":"そうなんですか。トラックポイントのキャップにソフトリムを使ってるんですが、自分の場合はこれだと他のデバイスと比べても一番負担が少ないですね。現行品のソフトドームと IBM 時代のクラシックドームはだめです。クラシックドームは Lenovo 公式でコレクターズ品として買う以外にないので常用できないので問題ないですし、ソフトドームは１日使ってこれはダメだと机の奥にしまいこまれました。","ts":"1628506777.303800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R0CI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f6e3d48f-a74e-4a70-806c-b992bd1ef912","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"私はトラックポイントで腱鞘炎になった","ts":"1628505848.300800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AoZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c715f486-8076-4544-9ad7-211696ee4eae","type":"message","user":"U76V658V6","text":"ただ経験上一番負担が少ないのは ThinkPad Keyboard  のトラックポイント。","ts":"1628505238.300300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":2,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS","U02AD39GK98"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bjUj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8ea36e95-7119-4542-aedb-9f2263183231","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"腱鞘炎つらそう","ts":"1628505200.299600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+LFKK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eb324d1b-9b45-4b62-b48e-2f9f1e1e0dcc","type":"message","user":"U76V658V6","text":"ELECOM HUGEとDEFTは予想したより親指を酷使するので SlimBlade の導入を急ぐ必要があるかもです。","ts":"1628505139.299400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d3sh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"161bf03d-0d11-4138-9e63-d3b5d675361a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"親指トラックボールは腱鞘炎が怖くて避けた","ts":"1628505090.298200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=C/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2a88e7b0-be4c-4120-bea6-b0a229d12cf1","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"親指の酷使が危険なのはスマホやタブレットで実証済み","ts":"1628505065.297900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U776661HA","U9S4G0LJW"]},{"name":"sorena","count":2,"users":["U776661HA","U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kyl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2a8673e0-6730-4624-bf54-6a41f2670ef0","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"親指タイプより大玉タイプの方がよいと思う","ts":"1628505046.297400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jo2o"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cd4546a2-84c4-46f3-8c20-bba23b62b631","type":"message","user":"U76V658V6","text":"マウスで手首を痛めたのでトラックボールに変えたのですが、親指タイプのトラックボールを使っていて今度は狭窄性腱鞘炎をおこしかけてるという……\n今の所、ELECOM HUGE が一番負担が少なくて次点が ELECOM DEFT。それでもいろいろ痛みがでてくるので、SlimBlade を試してみたい所存。","ts":"1628504921.296700","edited":{"user":"U76V658V6","ts":"1628505045.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QFbH/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ec43261b-12a7-4568-95ad-5dacde0102fc","type":"message","user":"U76V658V6","text":"まめに手指を休ませないといけないのはわかってるんですが、夢中になってるとつい忘れてしまうんですよね。","ts":"1628504796.295500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HiQK/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0b3bf15e-e448-456f-9392-8bd0a1b7ee8a","type":"message","user":"U76V658V6","text":"スマホは外出時以外はごく短時間しか使わないので、やはりキーボードとトラックボール。","ts":"1628504735.294800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"C4Sy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"54ff0897-bee1-45ad-a38d-93ceab54678a","type":"message","user":"U76V658V6","text":"関節に注射するとか腱鞘を手術で切開するとか、あんまりしたくないので、今回も早めのテーピングで乗り切りたい。","ts":"1628504623.293700","edited":{"user":"U76V658V6","ts":"1628504663.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EOhyM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"09130215-9a07-4ead-97f7-fe33e7a0ff73","type":"message","user":"U76V658V6","text":"右は狭窄性腱鞘炎をおこしかけてて、左は手首の甲側中央付近。左のほうはすでに結構痛い。病院はいやでござる。","ts":"1628504519.292400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iqD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8f40353e-1300-43c5-b5aa-21a3254a5402","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"キーボードマウスだけでなくスマホでも腱鞘炎なるのでお気をつけて","ts":"1628504464.291600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s5mL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2f8d3329-9d4a-4c69-93ec-28460f1536e0","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"職業病ですな","ts":"1628504445.290600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o9/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6a7b7626-aeaa-4bc8-8a51-2793832cb95c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"腱鞘炎こわい","ts":"1628504289.289400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sYFX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1f9be903-8c06-439b-8327-ec1f54afd6e0","type":"message","user":"U76V658V6","text":"また腱鞘炎をおこしかけてるので 38mm 幅のキネシオテープをポチるなどした。","ts":"1628504248.289200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"odaijini","count":4,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U7JL1UKKL","U013QL1RAPN","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kjNmV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"66007319-d2d3-4514-87a0-ee4d2b39c5fd","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"これ、難しいんだよなぁ","ts":"1628479390.288600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XSw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"533fc599-1cca-4313-8428-7eea2b9df44d","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u003chttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aN98D1YD00o\u003e","ts":"1628479376.288100","attachments":[{"fallback":"YouTube Video: 【超簡単】フロント、ビハインド、アンダーグリップのラットプルダウン3種目のポイントを徹底解説です。","id":1,"author_name":"ザ・きんにくTV 【The Muscle TV】","author_link":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOUu8YlbaPz0W2TyFTZHvjA","title":"【超簡単】フロント、ビハインド、アンダーグリップのラットプルダウン3種目のポイントを徹底解説です。","title_link":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aN98D1YD00o","thumb_url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/aN98D1YD00o/hqdefault.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"YouTube","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/youtube.png","thumb_width":480,"thumb_height":360,"video_html":"\u003ciframe width=\"400\" height=\"225\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/